<title>FINLAND: Nokian Renkaat 1996 profit rises 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Nokian Renkaat 1996 profit rises 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	    119 vs 96</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   8.30 vs 6.93</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    2.90 vs 2.40</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,145 vs 1,113</p>
<p> Depreciation					54.7 vs 47.8</p>
<p> Operating profit				 139.8 vs 120.2</p>
<p> Net financial items		    charge 20.6 vs 23.8 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 6.3 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						 35.4 vs 26.8</p>
<p> Net profit					  83.8 vs 63.3</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    41.9 vs 39.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Nokian Renkaat Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
